WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.569
-Nicole, I thought
it'd be fun to play a game

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:03.769
to see how well
we know each other.

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:04.904
You in?
-Yes.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.373
-Okay, good. Now --
-Yes, I'm definitely in.

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:08.908
I'm excited.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.142
-Yeah, good.

00:00:10.142 --> 00:00:11.845
Here's how this works.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:13.245
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.245 --> 00:00:15.081
It's just like
"The Newlywed Game"

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.983
where we try to match
each other's answers,

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:19.118
but we've never even dated,
so --

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:20.252
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.252 --> 00:00:21.587
So it might be --
It might be harder.

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:22.755
It might be a bit harder.

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:26.225
This is "The Neverwed Game."
Here we go.

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:30.964
-Hell nah!
♪ The Neverwed Game ♪

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.565
-Nicole, this is going
to be fun, I think.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.401
Now, some of these
questions will be about me,

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:37.003
some of these questions
will be about you,

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:39.872
and we'll both write down
our answers in secret.

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:42.642
If the answers match,
we get a point.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:44.177
-Okay. Yes.

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:47.012
-Nicole, this first question
is about you.

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:50.016
Nicole Kidman,
what is your biggest fear?

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:52.618
-Uh, my biggest fear,
'cause I have a lot.

00:00:52.618 --> 00:00:54.854
-I know.
I think this is one of them.

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.156
You can write three of them
if you want.

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:58.190
I have one of them, I think.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:01.294
-Okay, just hold on.
Hold on, hold on.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.595
-My gosh.

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:05.598
-Oh, God.
I'm taking it too seriously.

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.066
-Me?

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:10.102
I-I'm having fun here.

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:12.504
-Yeah?
-Yeah.

00:01:12.504 --> 00:01:15.508
-Uh, well, don't -- Uh...

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.542
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:18.378
Oh, God. Okay.

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:19.412
Just do it.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:20.780
-Alright, ready for this?
-No.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.047
-No, 3 --

00:01:22.047 --> 00:01:24.083
-I've put nothing.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.285
Nothing.

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:27.219
[ Applause ]

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:29.756
-No, the game works like this.
You have to put something.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:32.958
What is one of your biggest
fears, just your biggest fear?

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:34.460
Doesn't have to be --
-I have no fear.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.495
-Alright, okay.

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:36.562
-None.

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:37.930
-How about --

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.465
-There. It's there.

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:40.866
-Sharks.

00:01:40.866 --> 00:01:43.669
Sharks.
-No, that is so wrong.

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:45.804
You are so wrong.
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:45.804 --> 00:01:47.140
-You live -- You're from
Australia. There's like --

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.975
-Because I love sharks.

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:51.544
I love sharks.
I've scuba dived with sharks,

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:52.745
and I love sharks.

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.614
-No, you said, "I love sharrks."

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:58.017
And your real accent
is "shawks."

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.251
-Shawk.
-"I love shawks."

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:00.486
-Shawks.
-Yeah, you said sharks.

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:02.689
-Yeah, yeah, yeah,
sometimes I roll my R's

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:04.424
because I have to play American.

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:06.292
But I'm now Australian,
and I love shawks.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.761
-Well, you might love sharks,
but you don't like shawks.

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:09.796
Okay, alright.

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.263
-There, look.
-So we're 0 for 1.

00:02:11.263 --> 00:02:12.832
-I mean, come on.

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:14.634
No fear.
-Come on. That's how you play?

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.035
"No fear" --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:17.069
[ Dinging ]

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:19.371
That's a meme right there.

00:02:19.371 --> 00:02:21.307
Okay. This next one is --
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:24.410
-Nicole, this next one
is about me. Ready?

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.645
-Yeah.
-Which -- Which Disney character

00:02:26.645 --> 00:02:28.681
am I the most like?

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.550
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:33.586
♪♪

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:36.756
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:38.257
Oh, I have no idea.

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:40.226
Which Disney character.

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:43.596
Wait, hold on.

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.264
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:47.433
Are you showing it?

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:50.536
Are you showing it?
Are you showing it right now?

00:02:50.536 --> 00:02:53.206
Don't --
[ Applause ]

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:55.374
Don't show it yet.
Don't show it yet.

00:02:55.374 --> 00:02:56.876
-I can't help it.

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:58.444
[ Laughter ]
-Alright, I said --

00:02:58.444 --> 00:02:59.912
-I'm excited by it.

00:02:59.912 --> 00:03:02.048
-I said Mickey Mouse.

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:04.083
Don't say Goof--
-I said Little Mermaid.

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:06.052
[ Laughter ]
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:08.554
♪♪

00:03:08.554 --> 00:03:10.622
[ Applause ]

00:03:10.622 --> 00:03:12.425
Little Mermaid.

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:14.761
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:17.263
-I remind you
of the Little Mermaid?

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:18.464
-Yeah!
-Oh, my --

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:19.665
-So cute.

00:03:19.665 --> 00:03:21.500
-Oh! My gosh.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.936
[ Both giggling ]

00:03:23.936 --> 00:03:25.672
You are unbelievable, man.

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:26.939
Oh, my gosh.

00:03:26.939 --> 00:03:29.075
Alright. Alright.
Here we go. This one --

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:30.476
[ Giggles ]

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:33.078
This one is about you, okay?
Here we go.

00:03:33.078 --> 00:03:36.682
Is your go-to karaoke song

00:03:36.682 --> 00:03:38.317
"Mamma Mia" by ABBA

00:03:38.317 --> 00:03:41.887
or "You Shook Me All Night Long"
by AC/DC?

00:03:41.887 --> 00:03:43.622
-Oh.

00:03:43.622 --> 00:03:45.157
-Is your go-to karaoke song --

00:03:45.157 --> 00:03:46.725
It's one of these two, I guess.

00:03:46.725 --> 00:03:48.828
-Do I have to answer
one of those two?

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:50.230
-Yes.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:53.065
You have to play the game
at one point.

00:03:53.065 --> 00:03:55.701
-Okay.
-Gosh.

00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:57.870
-"Shook Me --"

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.439
-I think I know the answer
to this one.

00:04:00.439 --> 00:04:03.276
♪♪

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:04.844
Mm, maybe not.
-I --

00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:06.011
-Oh.
-No, ready?

00:04:06.011 --> 00:04:08.481
1, 2, 3.
-You're funny.

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:09.681
Go.
-Okay.

00:04:09.681 --> 00:04:10.817
My writing is so bad.

00:04:10.817 --> 00:04:12.951
-Yes! I think we got one!
[ Ding ]

00:04:12.951 --> 00:04:14.486
AC/DC!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:14.486 --> 00:04:15.688
-Yeah.
-See?

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:18.957
-But that --
I would have chosen "Mamma Mia,"

00:04:18.957 --> 00:04:22.094
but I actually prefer
"You Shook Me All Night Long."

00:04:22.094 --> 00:04:23.629
-Yeah, I-I got that,

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:24.830
and I know I love AC--

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:25.965
I knew that you
would rock AC/DC.

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:28.033
-I love AC/DC.
-Me, too. Me, too.

00:04:28.033 --> 00:04:29.335
I love AC/DC.
-I love AC/DC.

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:30.503
-I knew it!
I knew it, I knew it.

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:32.138
We got one right. This is big.

00:04:32.138 --> 00:04:35.741
-But I love ABBA,
but I love AC/DC.

00:04:35.741 --> 00:04:37.309
-This one's weird.
This one's about me --

00:04:37.309 --> 00:04:38.845
-You're ignoring me!

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:39.979
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.979 --> 00:04:42.215
-No, I heard you.
You said you love AC/DC.

00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:43.549
-Okay.

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:44.917
-No, I --
-But you didn't, like,

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:47.819
really kind of take that
and run with it.

00:04:47.819 --> 00:04:49.321
-No, I did take it
and run with it.

00:04:49.321 --> 00:04:52.958
The only reason I didn't
elaborate is because I know --

00:04:52.958 --> 00:04:54.793
-Because you're like,
"Who cares?"

00:04:54.793 --> 00:04:56.362
-No, I --
[ Laughter ]

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:58.264
I love --
I love that you love that.

00:04:58.264 --> 00:05:01.433
I think people would think
"Mamma Mia," but I know you,

00:05:01.433 --> 00:05:05.204
and I think Australia and AC/DC,
they're like royalty there.

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:06.605
-Yeah.
-They're Australian.

00:05:06.605 --> 00:05:08.841
-Yeah, absolutely.
-Alright, here we go.

00:05:08.841 --> 00:05:10.342
This next one is...
-Yeah.

00:05:10.342 --> 00:05:14.346
-Which one of us is most likely
to get a tattoo?

00:05:14.346 --> 00:05:16.182
Me or you?

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:21.487
♪♪

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:24.357
Yeah, I got this.
Me. I know that.

00:05:24.357 --> 00:05:27.060
Yeah. I would never get one.

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:29.294
I would never get a tattoo.

00:05:29.294 --> 00:05:30.496
But I know that you --

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:33.266
I feel like
you would never get a tattoo.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:34.767
-Yeah, I would never-never.

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:36.702
-Yeah, me, too.
-'Cause if we would both never,

00:05:36.702 --> 00:05:38.538
somebody has to be never-never.

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:40.005
-Yeah, I think
you're never-never --

00:05:40.005 --> 00:05:41.774
Yeah, I could, like, maybe
be tricked into maybe --

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:45.444
-You're like maybe
10 shots and...

00:05:45.444 --> 00:05:47.113
[ Laughter ]
...a million bucks.

00:05:47.113 --> 00:05:50.683
-Yeah, I was just thinking,
I would just get maybe like --

00:05:50.683 --> 00:05:54.019
If I got a tattoo,
I'd get a freckle.

00:05:54.019 --> 00:05:56.255
-A freckle?
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.255 --> 00:05:57.523
Oh.
-That's what I would get, yeah.

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:59.825
-No, well, then,
I would get a freckle.

00:05:59.825 --> 00:06:03.162
I actually, if that was
a choice, I'd get a freckle.

00:06:03.162 --> 00:06:04.297
-Would you?

00:06:04.297 --> 00:06:07.400
-Yeah, I like fre--
A mole, a mole.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.901
-Oh --

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:11.837
[ Laughter ]

00:06:11.837 --> 00:06:12.971
You're like, "What?"

00:06:12.971 --> 00:06:14.707
-A mole.
-You know, there, I love that,

00:06:14.707 --> 00:06:17.142
that Cindy Crawford mole.
-Yes, no, I love that one, too,

00:06:17.142 --> 00:06:18.710
Marilyn, Cindy, yeah.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.680
You would do that in the face?
-Yeah, I would get it.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.248
-Alright, this is
for the whole win.

00:06:22.248 --> 00:06:23.782
So far, we've done well.
-Right.

00:06:23.782 --> 00:06:26.485
So far, who is winning?
It's very, very confusing.

00:06:26.485 --> 00:06:29.555
-It turns out that this is
a team game is what it --

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:32.057
I don't think we were playing
against each other at all.

00:06:32.057 --> 00:06:33.993
So we're playing
with each other.

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:35.594
[ Laughter ]

00:06:35.594 --> 00:06:37.029
-I like it. It's fun.

00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:38.898
-Yeah, this is fun. Alright --
-More!

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:41.167
-This last one is a two-parter.
-More!

00:06:41.167 --> 00:06:43.502
[ Laughter ]

00:06:43.502 --> 00:06:44.837
-We're going to
answer it for you,

00:06:44.837 --> 00:06:47.206
and then we're going
to answer it for me.

00:06:47.206 --> 00:06:50.543
Which emoji do you use the most?

00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:55.815
So, put two emojis
on your thing, for you.

00:06:55.815 --> 00:06:58.985
Put one for you first
and then one for me.

00:06:58.985 --> 00:07:00.919
-Oh, right.

00:07:00.919 --> 00:07:02.989
-I know the answer.
-Oh.

00:07:02.989 --> 00:07:05.857
I wouldn't have a clue
what emoji you use,

00:07:05.857 --> 00:07:08.160
but I'm going to do mine,

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:11.663
but I don't have the right pen.

00:07:11.663 --> 00:07:14.133
I do that.

00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:15.801
Oh, I'll do yours.

00:07:15.801 --> 00:07:17.803
[ Laughter ]

00:07:17.803 --> 00:07:20.005
♪♪

00:07:20.005 --> 00:07:23.242
-You ready?
-It's --

00:07:23.242 --> 00:07:24.309
-Wait.

00:07:24.309 --> 00:07:26.178
We did it!

00:07:26.178 --> 00:07:27.312
Did we do it?
[ Ding ]

00:07:27.312 --> 00:07:29.348
-No, no. Mine has the --

00:07:29.348 --> 00:07:31.083
It's you blowing a kiss.

00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:33.252
-[ Laughs ]
Oh, I'm blowing a kiss.

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:34.654
I thought I was happy.
Alright, good.

00:07:34.654 --> 00:07:36.588
Alright, I'll do both.
Alright, good.

00:07:36.588 --> 00:07:38.958
That's our pal right there.
-Wow!

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:40.459
-That is Nicole Kidman.
-That's phenomenal.

00:07:40.459 --> 00:07:41.794
We were very, very in sync.

00:07:41.794 --> 00:07:43.562
-Can you stay
for the whole show?

00:07:43.562 --> 00:07:46.298
Check out the finale
of "Nine Perfect Strangers"

00:07:46.298 --> 00:07:47.733
tomorrow on Hulu.

